    "detailed_description": "With pixel-art aesthetics and dark fantasy vibes, every run presents new foes, relics, and spells to discover. Adapt your strategy, make crucial decisions, and shape your destiny with every card drawn. Will you master the arcane arts and conquer the ever-changing world of Arcanard?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:\u2028<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Roguelike deck-building \u2013 Experiment with endless card combinations and unique playstyles.\u2028<br />\r\n\u26a1 9 elemental powers \u2013 Build strategies around Fire, Ice, Electro, and more.\u2028\ud83d\udcdc Procedurally generated adventure \u2013 No two runs are ever the same.\u2028<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Pixel-art aesthetic \u2013 Immersive fantasy visuals with a dark, mysterious atmosphere.\u2028<br />\r\n\u2694\ufe0f Turn-based tactical combat \u2013 Outsmart enemies with careful planning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare for a thrilling, ever-evolving adventure where every decision matters. Will you rise as the ultimate elemental master?",
